Joseph Smith, and I accept it. I wish your church members could be fair enough to discuss this subject on its merits. I again recommend you to a careful reading of the quotations in my open letter. You will find them as follows: Book of Mormon --
2 Nephi 9:35; Alma 1:13-14 and 42:19. Bible -- Inspired Version, Genesis 9:12-13; Luke 11:50; Hebrews 9:22 and 10:26-29;
1 John 3:15 and 5:16. To these I will add: "Whoso killeth any person, the murderer shall be put to death by the mouth of witnesses; but one witness shall not testify against any person to cause him to die.
